01:13:59.826 --> 01:14:00.826
And that simply means...

524
01:14:01.826 --> 01:14:08.826
Because you never said a wholehearted yes.

525
01:14:13.826 --> 01:14:17.826
Yes, you have read it, but you did not respond, you did nothing with it.

