594
01:21:18.826 --> 01:21:19.826
Absolutely He will.

595
01:21:19.826 --> 01:21:24.826
But you cannot say in advance, will I have this or will I get this.

596
01:21:24.826 --> 01:21:25.826
No, that is not how it works.

597
01:21:29.826 --> 01:21:31.826
