598
01:21:39.826 --> 01:21:41.826
And the answer is, yes, Lord.

599
01:21:41.826 --> 01:21:44.826
And You will lead and You will provide in every season.

600
01:21:45.826 --> 01:21:47.826
The answer is, yes, Lord.

601
01:21:47.826 --> 01:21:50.826
I follow you and I trust you to take care of me.

602
01:22:07.826 --> 01:22:13.826
The guarantee of personal comfort and security must, you must die to that before you can follow him.

603
01:22:15.826 --> 01:22:21.826
And because we live here in the west, we already have comfort and luxury.

604
01:22:31.826 --> 01:22:36.826
Therefore, this is one of the greatest resistances to following the lamp.

605
01:22:45.826 --> 01:22:51.826
And the things that make us feel strong in the natural do not make us feel strong in the spiritual.

