01:25:19.826 --> 01:25:22.826
So having has two sides.

634
01:25:27.826 --> 01:25:31.826
What I see, and what the Lord says, is truly blessed.

635
01:25:35.826 --> 01:25:38.826
And what the Lord says, is truly blessed.

636
01:25:42.826 --> 01:25:45.826
And what the Lord says, is truly blessed.

